  "description": "Cocos2D-Mono.Core is a metapackage variant of Cocos2D-Mono that excludes the MonoGame.Content.Builder.Task MSBuild target. Reference this package instead of Cocos2D-Mono if you do not use the MonoGame content pipeline. The runtime DLL (Cocos2DMono.dll) is identical - only the build-time content-pipeline flow differs.",
